# =============================================================================
# SECURITY FIRST
# This project handles Microsoft 365 tenant configuration. Credentials, tokens,
# and anything tenant-identifying must NEVER be committed. When in doubt, add it.
# =============================================================================

# --- Secrets, credentials, tokens (backstop; the app itself never writes these) ---
# Match secret-bearing files by EXTENSION or WELL-KNOWN NAME, not by the mere
# presence of "credential"/"token"/"secret" as a substring — a broad substring
# match silently drops legitimate source and docs (e.g. CredentialProvider.ps1 or
# 04-...-credential-cleanup.md). Silent drops violate our loud-failure tenet.
# Anything genuinely sensitive/machine-specific belongs under a local/ path (below).
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.cer
*.crt
*.der
*.pass
*.secret
*.secrets
*.credential
*.credentials
credentials.json
credentials.xml
credentials.yml
credentials.yaml
secrets/
.secrets/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.publishsettings

# Auth / token caches (Microsoft.Graph, MSAL, Azure) and EXO temp modules — never commit.
# Paths confirmed in docs/research/04-authentication-and-credential-cleanup.md.
.graph/
.azure/
.msal/
mg.msal.cache*
*.msalcache*
ecache.bin*
*.tokencache
.tokencache/
tmpEXO*.psm1

# --- Runtime / local-only config & profiles ---
# Profiles under profiles/ are config-only and SHOULD be shareable. Anything
# suffixed .local or placed under a local/ subfolder is machine-specific and
# excluded (this is where anything sensitive or exported-with-data belongs).
*.local
*.local.*
local/
**/local/
profiles/local/

# --- Logs (verbose logging is a feature; the log FILES are not committed) ---
logs/
*.log
*.log.*

# --- OS cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Editor / IDE ---
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.shared.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Build artifacts (PowerShell 7 per ADR-0005; Node for the local dashboard per ADR-0006) ---
# .NET / PowerShell
bin/
obj/
*.nupkg
# Node (local web dashboard, ADR-0006)
node_modules/
dist/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*

# --- Containers / tooling ---
*.pid
.tmp/
tmp/
coverage/
